OL,3,GNEWSAManslaughter charge after fatal
OL,4,Apub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after a man died following
OL,8,Fan altercation at a pub.
OL,10,FThe victim, who was in his 50s, was
OL,11,Ffound with serious injuries at the Star
OL,12,FHotel in Cudworth, Barnsley, just
OL,13,Fbefore 23:30 BST on Friday, and was
OL,14,Ftaken to hospital where he later died.
OL,16,FLiam McGuire, 33, of Stocks Lane in
OL,17,FBarnsley, had since been charged with
OL,18,Fmanslaughter, South Yorkshire Police
OL,19,Fsaid on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
